{
  "title": "Lively Norwegian Chicken Liver Stew",
  "description": "A traditional Norwegian post-workout dish featuring chicken liver, infused oil, and low-carb ingredients, served in a hot pot vessel. This sour and chewy stew is perfect for a cold winter evening.",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
  "diet": [
    "low-carb",
